\param id Controller ID returned by registration.
\return An independent value describing the controller.
*/

/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::setAnimationJiggleSettings(number id, AnimationJiggleSettings settings)
\brief Patch tuning without changing topology.

See \ref procedural_jiggle_options and \ref procedural_jiggle_state.

\param id Controller ID returned by registration.
\param settings Sparse tuning patch; omitted fields retain their current values.
*/

/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::setAnimationJiggleEnabled(number id, boolean enabled)
\brief Enable or freeze jiggle; reenabling reseeds from the current pose.

See \ref procedural_jiggle_options and \ref procedural_jiggle_state.

\param id Controller ID returned by registration.
\param enabled Whether to apply and simulate the controller.
*/

