\fn pdg::Sprite::isAnimationJiggleEnabled(number id)
\brief Return whether jiggle is enabled.

See \ref procedural_jiggle_options and \ref procedural_jiggle_state.

\param id Controller ID returned by registration.
\return An independent value describing the controller.
*/

/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::setAnimationJiggleInfluence(number id, number influence, number seconds)
